\newlabel{fig:motivation}{{1}{1}{(a) An example of GSR. Given this image, a GSR model needs to not only predict the verb category \texttt  {buying}, but also detect (\textit  {i}.\textit  {e}., classify and ground) all corresponding semantic roles for \texttt  {buying} event, such as \texttt  {agent}, \texttt  {goods}, and \texttt  {payment}. (b) An overview of the existing two-stage GSR framework, which consists of a verb model and an RNN-based noun model to detect all roles autoregressively. }{}{}}
